    fix(optics): correct reflectivity to R=0.98 (Vikuiti 3M ESR spec) in CreateBarSkinReflector
    
    R=0.95 was a configuration error; the Vikuiti 3M ESR manufacturer spec is R≈0.98.
    Investigation (§1) confirmed that with explicit REFLECTIVITY on the dielectric_dielectric
    surface, Fresnel equations are bypassed — RINDEX of the Mylar volume is not consulted.
    Only the surface value matters. G4_MYLAR and VikuitiXXXLV name preserved (optically inert).
    
